        &lt;h2 style=3D"margin:0 0 6px; color:#fef08a;"&gt;&lt;i class=3D"f=
a-solid fa-thumbtack" style=3D"color:#f87171;"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Community Cork=
 Board&lt;/h2&gt;
