n-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir=3D"ltr" dat=
a-path-to-node=3D"0">That mosaic collage concept=E2=80=94small squares and =
rectangles showing real, unfiltered caregiver moments behind your frosted-g=
lass login card=E2=80=94will give <b data-path-to-node=3D"0" data-index-in-=
node=3D"147">The Harbor</b> (<code data-path-to-node=3D"0" data-index-in-no=
de=3D"159">shareyourwalk.com</code>) an authentic <i data-path-to-node=3D"0=
" data-index-in-node=3D"191">"finally here, check it out"</i> feel right aw=
ay.</p><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"1">Because you are building a pu=
blic-facing website, you want to avoid grabbing random images off Google Im=
ages (which can lead to copyright issues) and instead use <b data-path-to-n=
ode=3D"1" data-index-in-node=3D"162">free, royalty-free photo libraries</b>=
 or <b data-path-to-node=3D"1" data-index-in-node=3D"200">AI image generati=
on</b> so you own full commercial/public usage rights.</p><h3 dir=3D"ltr" d=
ata-path-to-node=3D"2">1. Where to Grab Real, Royalty-Free Caregiver &amp; =
Disability Photos (Free)</h3><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"3">These s=
ites let you download high-resolution <code data-path-to-node=3D"3" data-in=
dex-in-node=3D"45">.jpg</code> images completely free for websites with no =
copyright headaches:</p><ul dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"4"><li><p dir=
=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,0" data-in=
dex-in-node=3D"0">Pexels (<code data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,0" data-index-in-n=
ode=3D"8">pexels.com</code>) &amp; Unsplash (<code data-path-to-node=3D"4,0=
,0" data-index-in-node=3D"32">unsplash.com</code>):</b> Great for authentic=
, emotional everyday moments. Search terms like:</p><ul dir=3D"ltr" data-pa=
th-to-node=3D"4,0,1"><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,0,0"><i =
data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">"stressed mother c=
hild tantrum"</i> or <i data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node=
=3D"35">"exhausted parent living room"</i></p></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-=
path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,1,0"><i data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,1,0" data-index-in=
-node=3D"0">"caregiver helping wheelchair"</i> or <i data-path-to-node=3D"4=
,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"34">"wheelchair transfer bed"</i></p></li><=
li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,2,0"><i data-path-to-node=3D"4=
,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">"amputee adult prosthetic"</i> or <i dat=
a-path-to-node=3D"4,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"30">"person with disabil=
ity smiling"</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"=
4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"4,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Disabled And=
 Here (<code data-path-to-node=3D"4,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"19">[affectt=
heverb.com/collection](https://affecttheverb.com/collection)</code>):</b> A=
 free, community-led stock photo collection specifically featuring disabled=
 adults, wheelchair users, and caregivers in everyday life (requires a simp=
le credit line in your site footer).</p></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-t=
o-node=3D"4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"4,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Na=
ppy (<code data-path-to-node=3D"4,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"7">nappy.co</c=
ode>):</b> Free, candid family and caregiving photography with authentic ho=
me settings.</p></li></ul><h3 dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"5">2. Where =
to Create Custom Scenes Directly (AI Image Generation)</h3><p dir=3D"ltr" d=
ata-path-to-node=3D"6">For very specific scenes=E2=80=94like a mom holding =
her head in exhaustion while a child throws toys in the background, or a ca=
regiver safely transferring a loved one from a wheelchair to a bed=E2=80=94=
generating custom images gives you exact control over the mood, lighting, a=
nd framing:</p><ul dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"7"><li><p dir=3D"ltr" d=
ata-path-to-node=3D"7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"7,0,0" data-index-in-nod=
e=3D"0">Right Here with Me (Nano Banana 2):</b> You can ask me directly in =
this chat to generate any of those scenes one by one (e.g., <i data-path-to=
-node=3D"7,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"123">"Generate a realistic, warm-tone=
d photo of an exhausted mother sitting at a kitchen table holding her head =
while a young boy tosses toys in the background"</i>), and then download ea=
ch image straight to your Chromebook.</p></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-=
to-node=3D"7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">C=
anva (<code data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"7">canva.com<=
/code>):</b> You already use Canva for design work=E2=80=94its built-in <b =
data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"70">Magic Media</b> gener=
ator and free photo library also let you generate and resize square (<code =
data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"156">1:1</code>) and rect=
angular (<code data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"178">16:9<=
/code> or <code data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"186">4:3<=
/code>) tiles in one place.</p></li></ul><h3 dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=
=3D"8">3. How We'll Wire the Mosaic Collage Behind Your Frosted-Glass Login=
 Card</h3><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"9">Once you drop 6 to 10 <cod=
e data-path-to-node=3D"9" data-index-in-node=3D"22">.jpg</code> files into =
<b data-path-to-node=3D"9" data-index-in-node=3D"38"><code data-path-to-nod=
e=3D"9" data-index-in-node=3D"38">~/the-harbor/static/images/</code></b> (f=
or example, <code data-path-to-node=3D"9" data-index-in-node=3D"80">tile-1.=
jpg</code>, <code data-path-to-node=3D"9" data-index-in-node=3D"92">tile-2.=
jpg</code>, <code data-path-to-node=3D"9" data-index-in-node=3D"104">tile-3=
.jpg</code>, etc.):</p><ul dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"10"><li><p dir=
=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"10,0,0">We'll build a responsive <b data-path=
-to-node=3D"10,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"25">CSS Grid Bento Collage</b> (<=
code data-path-to-node=3D"10,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"49">grid-auto-flow:=
 dense</code>) fixed behind <code data-path-to-node=3D"10,0,0" data-index-i=
n-node=3D"85">.harbor-glass-card</code> that automatically mixes <b data-pa=
th-to-node=3D"10,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"129">small squares</b> and <b d=
ata-path-to-node=3D"10,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"147">wide/tall rectangles=
</b> with subtle rounded corners and soft depth.</p></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr"=
 data-path-to-node=3D"10,1,0">We'll add descriptive <code data-path-to-node=
=3D"10,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"22">alt=3D"..."</code> tags to every tile=
 so your collage stays <b data-path-to-node=3D"10,1,0" data-index-in-node=
=3D"73">WCAG 2.1 AA</b> accessible while letting caregivers immediately fee=
l seen the moment <code data-path-to-node=3D"10,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"=
154">shareyourwalk.com</code> loads.</p></li></ul><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-=
to-node=3D"11">Would you like me to generate a few of those specific scenes=
 for you right now, or do you want to grab a batch first and drop them into=
 <code data-path-to-node=3D"11" data-index-in-node=3D"136">static/images</c=
