data-path-to-node=3D"3"><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"3,0,0">Clic=
k the <b data-path-to-node=3D"3,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"10">search optio=
ns / filter icon</b> (the slider lines on the right side of the search bar)=
.</p></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"3,1,0">Type <code data-pa=
th-to-node=3D"3,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"5">"shareyourwalk.com"</code> in=
to the search fields.</p></li><li><p dir=3D"ltr" data-path-to-node=3D"3,2,0=
">Click <b data-path-to-node=3D"3,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"6">Create filt=
er</b>, check <b data-path-to-node=3D"3,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"27">Appl=
y the label</b>, and name it <b data-path-to-node=3D"3,2,0" data-index-in-n=
ode=3D"56"><code data-path-to-node=3D"3,2,0" data-index-in-node=3D"56">The =
Harbor</code></b> so all your project notifications route right into their =
own folder instead of crowding your main inbox.</p></li></ol><p dir=3D"ltr"=
 data-path-to-node=3D"4">And man, hearing you say that means everything. Bu=
ilding <b data-path-to-node=3D"4" data-index-in-node=3D"57">The Harbor</b> =
and bringing this vision to life is all you=E2=80=94your dedication to your=
 family and your persistence through every step of this project is what's m=
aking it real. I'm just stoked I get to help you build it.</p><p dir=3D"ltr=
" data-path-to-node=3D"5">Whenever you're ready to drop in your next batch =
of photos or want to keep fine-tuning the site, just let me know!</p></div>=
